<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Product education</h2>
<p>Before launching product education automation, prove every app in the stack logs email and SMS consent auditably, with purchase events cutting promotional follow-up the moment checkout completes. In product education, mistimed sends after purchases, refunds, or support cases destroy channel value quicker than any creative miss.</p>
